"""Pry Sports Odds Comparison - generated by the Actor Factory.

PPE runtime: charges 'odds-comparison-pulled' per processed URL via
push_data, respects user spending limits (event_charge_limit_reached), and
flushes completed work on platform abort. See ACTOR-FACTORY.md for methodology.

For each input URL (ESPN / odds API endpoint) the actor builds one
odds-comparison report per event: best lines across 112+ books, arbitrage
detection, and +EV opportunities with line movement tracking.
"""

